00:39:55,350 --> 00:39:58,350
我不能说2+2=5两次
I cannot say 2+2=5 twice.

709
00:39:58,350 --> 00:40:01,350
我不能说2+2=5两次
I cannot say 2+2=5 twice.

710
00:40:04,350 --> 00:40:08,350
这部真理机器就陷入了逻辑死循环。
The truth machine is caught in a logical trap.

711
00:40:08,350 --> 00:40:14,350
如果它重复命题，两次说了“2+2=5两次”，
If it repeats the statement and says "2+2=5 twice" twice,

712
00:40:14,350 --> 00:40:16,350
