it will make the statement false.

713
00:40:16,350 --> 00:40:21,350
但如果它继续沉默，就表示此命题为真。
But if it keeps silent, it will make it true.

714
00:40:21,350 --> 00:40:24,350
所以这部机器自相矛盾了，
So, the machine is contradicting itself,

715
00:40:24,350 --> 00:40:27,350
这也说明了真理机器
which basically shows the universal truth machine

